WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.462
Today we will connect the form of a useful object to its function. Our work connects

00:00:05.462 --> 00:00:08.093
with international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:12.150
Observe the pot rim, body, base and any decoration.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.531
Draw the outline using simple curved lines.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:22.304
Add a label showing how the pot might be used. Justify a revision using evidence from

00:00:22.304 --> 00:00:23.307
another world tradition.
